{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistrationfailure:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Handles push notification registration failure."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSError"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The NSError received from APNs registration failure"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"error"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your AppDelegate’s "},{"code":"application:didFailToRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithError:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to notify Pushwoosh about registration failures."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This allows Pushwoosh to:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Log the error for debugging","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retry registration if appropriate"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update device status in the Control Panel","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle registration failure with user feedback:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didFailToRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithError error: Error) {","","        \/\/ Forward to Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.handlePushRegistrationFailure(error as NSError)","","        \/\/ Log for debugging","        Logger.error(\"Push registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","","        \/\/ Handle specific error cases","        let nsError = error as NSError","        switch nsError.code {","        case 3010:","            \/\/ Simulator or push not supported","            Logger.warning(\"Push notifications not supported on this device\")","","        default:","            \/\/ Track error in analytics","            Analytics.track(\"push_registration_failed\", properties: [","                \"error_code\": nsError.code,","                \"error_message\": nsError.localizedDescription","            ])","","            \/\/ Optionally notify user","            if shouldShowPushError {","                showPushRegistrationError()","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistrationFailure:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handlePushRegistrationFailure:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:"}]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/handlePushRegistrationFailure:":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistrationFailure:","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistrationfailure:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Handles push notification registration failure.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:"}],"title":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","role":"symbol"}}}